theorem sfReflectionFunctionPH_conjunction_local(T F:set)(G domain level:nat)(E:set)(n i d X y z:nat)(hd:$ sfBound 1 domain $)(hl:$ sfBound 2 level $)(hv:$ sfPieceFunctionTableValid E n $)(hi:$ i < n $)(hm:$ sfReflectionDnMembers T G X (sfPieceFunctionCount E i) $)(hL:$ nsLocal G (sfORBinary level y d) $)(hP:$ nsLocal G (sfPieceFunctionConjunction domain level E n d X) $)(hS:$ nsLocal G (sfCLSubset y z) $): $ nsLocal G (sfReflectionEwAt domain (sfRename T 1 (sfPieceFunctionMatrix E i)) z) $;
